      "source": "todo_md",
      "tags": [],
      "text": "**Vault Note Enrichment v1 (2026-05-02): Each note now carries a `parent/<dir>` tag, one `lang/<name>` tag per detected language (python, node, ruby, swift, perl, c, r \u2014 by marker files in the repo root), and a `- Remote: <url>` bullet linking to the host repo (SSH\u2192HTTPS normalized, `.git` stripped). All bullets degrade gracefully when their data is absent.**\n- [x] Add host repo link (`git remote get-url origin`, SSH\u2192HTTPS, strip `.git`)\n- [x] Add `parent/<dir>` tag from the repo's containing directory\n- [x] Detect languages from root marker files and emit `lang/<name>` tags\n- [x] Re-run on `~/bin/` and confirm tags + host links render correctly\n\n`TODO.md:L113`",
